From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato <remourato@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:34:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Open Quick Look for clipboard images and files
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

⌘Y and a Quick Look row in the ⌘K menu preview an image or file entry in the
palette's overlay. The overlay is File Search's own, now taking a URL and name,
and its flag is shared as palette.quickLook.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
